  <h2>Path to Production</h2>
  <p>The <strong>CIO "Build with watsonx" Path to Production</strong> has been identified as the official deployment channel. A ServiceNow AI System Demand is being submitted with the architecture diagram. Upon Technical Review Board approval: IBM Cloud Code Engine deployment, CIO-managed watsonx.ai credentials, real IBM w3id SSO — available to any IBM Sales VP from any browser, no local installation required.</p>
  <p>Approval as an official IBM AI System creates standing to request a <strong>Salesforce Connected App with OAuth 2.0</strong> — eliminating the HAR step entirely. The same application, unchanged, serves any IBM Sales VP with a Salesforce-backed pipeline. IBM Public Market is the immediate target; broader IBM Sales organization adoption is the medium-term opportunity.</p>

